luential banker is doing everything possible not to share the property with his illegitimate sons. But when he is deprived of all the money, it turns out that only they can help Matthew ... To regain his fortune, the billionaire will be forced to rob his own bank in Monte Carlo. And for this, he will have to perform an even more difficult task: regain the trust of children who grew up without a father ..."},{"language":"ru-RU","title":"Миллиард","overview":"Влиятельный банкир делает всё возможное, чтобы не делиться имуществом со своими незаконнорожденными сыновьями. Но когда его лишают всех денег, выясняется, что помочь Матвею могут только они… Чтобы вернуть себе состояние, миллиардер будет вынужден пойти на ограбление собственного банка в Монте-Карло. А для этого ему придётся выполнить ещё более сложную задачу: вернуть доверие выросших без отца детей…"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/890EdXL45TSl3ANFmo5L5Ur0REV.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uAK6Sv89ty32mYH2m8jJx2odvKR.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":567801,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/890EdXL45TSl3ANFmo5L5Ur0REV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/890EdXL45TSl3ANFmo5L5Ur0REV.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/890EdXL45TSl3ANFmo5L5Ur0REV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/890EdXL45TSl3ANFmo5L5Ur0REV.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3ve4TipFEBcBuFxX9IXwlnsklMi.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3ve4TipFEBcBuFxX9IXwlnsklMi.jpg","language":"en","width":1050,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"typ